/// Average OEE target across the selected lines (from OeeTarget). Same definition as the OEEAnalytics semantic model measure [Target OEE].
metric TargetOee
	lineageTag: 6a239da6-a46d-5d6a-8fa3-a5a1127e33f0

	expression
		dialect: SQL
		expression: SELECT AVG(CAST(target_oee AS FLOAT)) FROM dbo.OeeTarget

	synonym 'OEE target'
